Last accepted Improve lessons (untrusted observations; revalidate relevance):
A conditional planning record can make dependencies visible without resolving them. Recovery flows need distinct authorized-draft, authorized-absence, and carrier-failure outcomes; treating failure as absence would conceal an unsafe or unavailable path. The read-only fixture cannot prove an ordinary product requirements-home update, a selected carrier/API, browser behavior, or target compatibility, so the global plan must retain named owner/documentation/test/target work. Terminal child packet: <study>/existing/product/.shiploop-improve/nav-ba797d421eb24ce8b9c19baeee54d59c/nav-d193b2f78738424b8a84d4161ff25bfe/packet-terminal.json.
